                    October 31; for text, see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bulletin</hi>, November 4, 1945, p. 709.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d364-f2" n="89" xml:id="d364-f2-content">
                <p>Statement by President Truman in New York, October 27; for text, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., October 28, 1945, p. 653.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
